WEBVTT

00:00:17.010 --> 00:00:20.320
Cuticle Detective Inaba

00:01:31.020 --> 00:01:34.360
We only eat special food prepared
Please do not give      us paper or grass.

00:01:34.690 --> 00:01:37.490
Rare goats from all over the globe!

00:01:37.760 --> 00:01:39.570
All can be found at the WORLD YAGI Park!

00:01:39.840 --> 00:01:42.160
If you look at goats carefully,
they aren't scary!

00:01:42.450 --> 00:01:46.040
Even you will be taken by the goatiness
of the goats and fall in love.

00:01:46.370 --> 00:01:49.680
Now, go be with the goats
to your heart's content!

00:01:50.040 --> 00:01:50.360
You call me on one of my
precious few days off,

00:01:50.360 --> 00:01:52.090
Nimbly
You call me on one of my
precious few days off,

00:01:52.090 --> 00:01:52.350
You call me on one of my
precious few days off,

00:01:52.350 --> 00:01:53.800
and what the hell is this?!

00:01:54.940 --> 00:01:58.800
Meeting Room

00:02:00.090 --> 00:02:01.590
Your moves look completely stopped.

00:02:01.590 --> 00:02:01.990
Stop using shadow clones!
Your moves look completely stopped.

00:02:01.990 --> 00:02:03.630
Stop using shadow clones!

00:02:03.630 --> 00:02:05.890
Stop playing around, you geezer duo.

00:02:06.260 --> 00:02:07.760
Don't turn out like that, Stella.

00:02:08.180 --> 00:02:09.850
And what are you, Ogata? A demon?

00:02:09.850 --> 00:02:11.860
What are you talking about?
This is out of kindness!

00:02:11.860 --> 00:02:14.110
Stop fooling around. What's your motive?

00:02:14.580 --> 00:02:16.620
I thought it was odd that the man who's

00:02:16.620 --> 00:02:18.000
supposedly my rival has had

00:02:18.000 --> 00:02:20.570
so many problems catching a single goat.

00:02:21.050 --> 00:02:22.530
And then I finally got it.

00:02:23.120 --> 00:02:24.830
Even though it took a while.

00:02:27.800 --> 00:02:30.210
You're scared of goats, aren't you, Ogi?

00:02:30.210 --> 00:02:31.750
There's a limit to the false
accusations I can take.

00:02:31.750 --> 00:02:33.650
And those fears can
come to an end today!

00:02:33.650 --> 00:02:35.820
Goats aren't scary at all!
They're just eating grass.

00:02:35.820 --> 00:02:37.170
I'm telling you, I'm not scared!

00:02:37.170 --> 00:02:38.840
Oh, don't try to act tough, Ogi.

00:02:39.220 --> 00:02:41.000
If we were coming for fun,
you should have told me.

00:02:41.380 --> 00:02:43.700
I would have brought Wakaba and Azusa.

00:02:43.700 --> 00:02:47.350
I should have brought my assistants.
Wait, should we even have fun?

00:02:47.610 --> 00:02:50.120
Not to worry! Everyone's here.

00:02:50.120 --> 00:02:51.490
How'd you pull that off?!

00:02:51.490 --> 00:02:53.360
The surprise was a huge success!

00:02:53.650 --> 00:02:56.380
Why do you get along
so well with my family?

00:02:56.380 --> 00:02:59.280
And no fair being all
buddy-buddy with my assistants.

00:03:01.990 --> 00:03:03.180
Listen well, Stella.

00:03:03.620 --> 00:03:05.460
We have a baby here today,

00:03:05.460 --> 00:03:07.790
so it's your job to be the older sister.

00:03:07.790 --> 00:03:09.270
Roger! Let's go.

00:03:13.310 --> 00:03:15.230
Look, it's Mr. Goat.

00:03:15.230 --> 00:03:16.900
Mr. Goat! Mr. Goat!

00:03:18.360 --> 00:03:20.540
Sisters... aren't bad.

00:03:20.960 --> 00:03:22.420
I'd like a son, too.

00:03:22.420 --> 00:03:23.750
Want to have as many as we can?

00:03:26.700 --> 00:03:28.470
Wow, that's awesome!

00:03:28.790 --> 00:03:30.630
Those horns would be fitting for a Don.

00:03:30.630 --> 00:03:32.090
It's still just a goat, though.

00:03:32.790 --> 00:03:33.710
Hey, it's looking over here.

00:03:33.710 --> 00:03:34.400
Don't look.

00:03:34.960 --> 00:03:37.940
I know it might be too much
to start with the horned ones,

00:03:37.940 --> 00:03:41.160
so there's a kid section over there
since you're scared of goats.

00:03:41.160 --> 00:03:43.530
Your misunderstanding is
getting seriously annoying.

00:03:47.990 --> 00:03:50.450
Goat Squid
Habitat: Ugojima

00:03:50.820 --> 00:03:53.150
A goat... squid?

00:03:53.150 --> 00:03:56.210
Since it's a squid, do you
think it lives in that lake?

00:03:56.640 --> 00:03:57.990
Doesn't look like anything's in there.

00:04:00.800 --> 00:04:01.740
Glance

00:04:01.740 --> 00:04:03.720
What do you mean, "glance"?
You're in full view!

00:04:03.990 --> 00:04:06.420
Oh, it's just a normal goat.

00:04:06.420 --> 00:04:07.120
Yep.

00:04:14.950 --> 00:04:16.810
It's actually goat-based!

00:04:17.060 --> 00:04:20.090
It has ten legs... how disgusting!

00:04:21.770 --> 00:04:22.860
It spit out ink!

00:04:22.860 --> 00:04:23.860
So it<i> is</i> a squid!

00:04:24.030 --> 00:04:24.460
Gooey

00:04:24.460 --> 00:04:27.410
So this place has rare goats that
goat lovers would die for.

00:04:30.220 --> 00:04:31.660
What's the matter, Kei-kun?

00:04:31.660 --> 00:04:33.230
I see some familiar gelatin...

00:04:33.230 --> 00:04:35.130
You have a gelatinous friend?

00:04:35.190 --> 00:04:35.450
Watch Episode 5!

00:04:35.450 --> 00:04:37.380
No, please forget it.

00:04:39.130 --> 00:04:40.870
Goat Feed

00:04:40.870 --> 00:04:43.310
There's a cat goat, too, Kei-chan.

00:04:43.310 --> 00:04:44.090
Goat Feed

00:04:44.340 --> 00:04:44.920
See?

00:04:44.950 --> 00:04:45.760
Meaaa

00:04:48.000 --> 00:04:50.740
So it looks like a cat outside,
but inside it's basically a goat.

00:04:50.740 --> 00:04:53.330
So this goat thinks it just
needs cat ears to pull it off?

00:04:53.330 --> 00:04:55.880
Though faces are only of secondary
importance to cat lovers.

00:04:55.880 --> 00:04:57.560
Both beautiful and ugly cats are cute,

00:04:57.560 --> 00:04:59.130
but it's because they both have cat faces.

00:04:59.130 --> 00:05:02.440
You don't understand the importance
of those fluffy bodies, goat.

00:05:02.440 --> 00:05:05.030
Even without Inaba-san here,
I can tell this isn't cat fur.

00:05:05.470 --> 00:05:06.840
Um...

00:05:06.840 --> 00:05:08.670
If you ask whether this is
acceptable or not, it's not.

00:05:08.670 --> 00:05:10.990
Kei-chan... You have the face
of a professional right now.

00:05:10.990 --> 00:05:12.870
Oberhasli
Alpine
La Mancha
Saanen
Cashmere
Angora

00:05:15.190 --> 00:05:16.500
What's the matter, Stella?

00:05:18.250 --> 00:05:20.460
Look, there's one as big as a horse.

00:05:20.460 --> 00:05:22.090
No! It's scary!

00:05:22.090 --> 00:05:23.900
Which feed should we get?

00:05:23.900 --> 00:05:25.080
I don't think it matters.

00:05:25.080 --> 00:05:26.960
Should have brought my camera...

00:05:27.250 --> 00:05:28.270
Poke, poke.

00:05:28.940 --> 00:05:30.180
Here you go.

00:05:31.810 --> 00:05:33.940
Look over here, everyone!

00:05:33.940 --> 00:05:35.410
And now Ogi's all excited, too.

00:05:35.410 --> 00:05:38.150
The way he acts on his days off
is always a bit disturbing.

00:05:38.740 --> 00:05:39.380
Stella.

00:05:40.870 --> 00:05:43.690
Could I get a picture with
you two and Mr. Goat?

00:05:45.550 --> 00:05:47.700
He's the one who always
gets mad at Yuzuki.

00:05:48.120 --> 00:05:50.640
The dark, big, scary guy.

00:05:55.560 --> 00:05:57.000
Sure.

00:05:57.780 --> 00:05:59.970
Wow, you can hold her?

00:05:59.970 --> 00:06:01.510
You're really strong, Stella.

00:06:01.510 --> 00:06:03.090
That's because I'm the big sister!

00:06:03.310 --> 00:06:05.360
Azusa-chan, is your daddy nice?

00:06:06.330 --> 00:06:07.460
Here we go!

00:06:08.890 --> 00:06:12.250
I'm sorry I thought you were a
scary man, Azusa-chan's daddy.

00:06:16.810 --> 00:06:17.940
Waaaah

00:06:17.940 --> 00:06:20.260
Don't flip into work mode
all a sudden, you idiot!

00:06:20.260 --> 00:06:22.560
Valentino! Valentino's here!

00:06:22.780 --> 00:06:23.870
What's going on?

00:06:23.870 --> 00:06:24.780
Hiroshi!

00:06:25.090 --> 00:06:27.510
It's Valentino!
He's somewhere in this park!

00:06:27.510 --> 00:06:29.120
You're totally obsessed with goats now.

00:06:29.120 --> 00:06:30.780
Why don't you just live here?

00:06:30.780 --> 00:06:33.790
No, that's not it.
I didn't say goat! I said Valentino!

00:06:33.790 --> 00:06:35.950
Er, I mean, he's a goat,
but not a goat goat...

00:06:35.950 --> 00:06:38.010
Wh-What am I trying to say?!

00:06:38.010 --> 00:06:40.250
Ogi... why don't you take some time off?

00:06:40.740 --> 00:06:42.330
What's wrong with Ogi-san?

00:06:42.330 --> 00:06:44.690
He said he saw a goat like <i>that</i> goat.

00:06:45.660 --> 00:06:49.930
Maybe there are other bipedal
goats like <i>that</i> goat, too.

00:06:52.080 --> 00:06:56.370
Noah! It's the wolf!
The wolf has appeared, it has!

00:06:56.370 --> 00:06:57.220
What?!

00:06:57.600 --> 00:06:58.970
This isn't good!

00:06:59.680 --> 00:07:03.930
I made my lab look like a farm
so they wouldn't find it.

00:07:03.930 --> 00:07:06.090
How are they even getting
their information?!

00:07:06.090 --> 00:07:08.210
We have underestimated them, we have!

00:07:08.210 --> 00:07:11.110
They're already going around and
taking pictures for evidence!

00:07:11.480 --> 00:07:12.880
Looks like I've got no choice.

00:07:12.880 --> 00:07:14.570
The true purpose of my chimera research,

00:07:14.570 --> 00:07:16.710
which is to make a Don body double,

00:07:16.710 --> 00:07:19.040
will be achieved once we fool them.

00:07:19.240 --> 00:07:21.710
Let's go see their reactions.

00:07:23.790 --> 00:07:24.380
Bipedal Goats Over Here!

00:07:24.380 --> 00:07:26.010
Wow, there are some.
Bipedal Goats Over Here!

00:07:26.010 --> 00:07:26.420
Bipedal Goats Over Here!

00:07:26.660 --> 00:07:29.580
Bipedal goats are seriously disturbing.

00:07:29.580 --> 00:07:33.160
So disturbing that the Don
actually sort of looks cute.

00:07:33.160 --> 00:07:34.850
I wish they'd all go extinct.

00:07:35.430 --> 00:07:38.100
Yuzuki, what does this say?

00:07:39.300 --> 00:07:41.160
"Fake Don, family: Mafia.

00:07:41.160 --> 00:07:42.510
From the sacrificial pawn genus,

00:07:42.510 --> 00:07:44.280
they are man-made bipedal goats.

00:07:44.280 --> 00:07:46.590
Made so similar to the Don that
the Don himself is impressed.

00:07:46.590 --> 00:07:49.030
They are primarily raised to be scapegoats."

00:07:49.380 --> 00:07:51.930
No matter how you look at it,
it is talking about <i>that</i> goat, right?

00:07:51.930 --> 00:07:53.960
What's it mean, "family: Mafia"?

00:07:53.960 --> 00:07:56.120
He's a goat, but he's
denying the cow family?

00:07:56.120 --> 00:07:59.040
The Mafia family goats
are crafty and cool

00:07:59.040 --> 00:08:01.200
and have a handsome face...

00:08:01.200 --> 00:08:01.940
So it says.

00:08:02.330 --> 00:08:03.910
Guess it's a different goat, then.

00:08:03.910 --> 00:08:05.710
Guess it was the wrong goat.

00:08:05.710 --> 00:08:06.680
They're such confusing goats.

00:08:06.680 --> 00:08:08.680
This is infuriating, it is.
They're such confusing goats.

00:08:08.680 --> 00:08:09.820
Just be quiet.

00:08:10.350 --> 00:08:13.180
The goat you saw is
probably in here, Ogi.

00:08:15.640 --> 00:08:16.760
No, it's not.

00:08:17.040 --> 00:08:19.260
He was easily able to tell
that they were fakes!

00:08:19.390 --> 00:08:22.110
I did think they were a little different...

00:08:22.110 --> 00:08:22.940
What?!

00:08:24.080 --> 00:08:26.910
Don't get cocky because you can
distinguish my failed experiments.

00:08:26.910 --> 00:08:29.750
My chimera research
is evolving every day.

00:08:29.750 --> 00:08:32.450
I'll bring you a new one while
it's still nice and hot!

00:08:32.450 --> 00:08:33.900
I'll look forward to it, I will...

00:08:34.340 --> 00:08:36.140
Since there are fake Dons here,

00:08:36.140 --> 00:08:37.550
the real one must be here, too.

00:08:37.550 --> 00:08:38.620
Wonder where he is.

00:08:38.880 --> 00:08:41.390
You should be used to goats by now, Ogi.

00:08:41.780 --> 00:08:44.400
Get in there and feed the fake Dons.

00:08:44.400 --> 00:08:47.380
It's not just now, I've been
used to goats for quite a while.

00:08:49.670 --> 00:08:50.870
Do you need me to go with you?

00:08:50.870 --> 00:08:54.380
I'll go by myself, so stop with that
annoying misunderstanding.

00:08:58.040 --> 00:08:59.650
Looks like you're super popular, Ogi.

00:08:59.650 --> 00:09:02.100
Right now is your prime!

00:09:02.100 --> 00:09:03.890
Honestly, I want them to scatter.

00:09:04.730 --> 00:09:06.170
What?

00:09:06.600 --> 00:09:07.640
They ran away all of a sudden.

00:09:07.640 --> 00:09:08.700
Ogi! Run!

00:09:08.700 --> 00:09:09.770
H-Hurry!

00:09:09.770 --> 00:09:10.790
I'm asking you, what is it?

00:09:10.790 --> 00:09:13.940
Behind you... I mean above you...
Look over there!

00:09:20.630 --> 00:09:23.460
It's the Don! That's the Don for sure!

00:09:23.460 --> 00:09:24.380
So scary!

00:09:24.870 --> 00:09:27.140
Totally on a different level
compared to other goats.

00:09:27.140 --> 00:09:29.330
Don! Don!
It's from the family
Mafia and genus Don.

00:09:30.940 --> 00:09:35.490
They haven't realized it's
the stand-in fake Don.

00:09:35.490 --> 00:09:37.420
The real one is right here, he is.

00:09:37.420 --> 00:09:40.470
Be fooled and tremble in fear, they will.

00:09:41.200 --> 00:09:43.080
If a big goat like him...

00:09:44.720 --> 00:09:48.900
lined up with Azusa,
she will look super small.

00:09:49.640 --> 00:09:51.520
That... That...

00:09:51.950 --> 00:09:53.230
No matter how you look at it...

00:09:53.930 --> 00:09:55.400
Would be super cute...

00:10:06.270 --> 00:10:07.630
Sit!

00:10:18.430 --> 00:10:22.600
Amazing! So amazing!
You're so cute, Azusa!

00:10:22.600 --> 00:10:25.250
So cute! It's too cute!

00:10:25.250 --> 00:10:26.270
Come join the picture, Stella.

00:10:26.270 --> 00:10:27.180
No!

00:10:27.540 --> 00:10:30.870
To think that Ogi is
standing above the Don...

00:10:30.870 --> 00:10:33.980
Inaba-san, you reacted to the "sit"?

00:10:33.980 --> 00:10:34.930
No...

00:10:34.930 --> 00:10:36.960
I-I was just admiring the grass...

00:10:38.810 --> 00:10:39.990
Ta-da!

00:10:40.220 --> 00:10:42.010
Congratulations, Ogi!

00:10:42.010 --> 00:10:44.120
The golden goat award is yours!

00:10:44.120 --> 00:10:44.700
Don't want it.

00:10:45.650 --> 00:10:46.840
At least look at it!

00:10:46.840 --> 00:10:47.930
Don't have time.

00:10:47.930 --> 00:10:51.510
Hey, goat! I told you the
golden Ogi award is yours!

00:10:52.930 --> 00:10:55.340
So... why'd they come here, anyway?

00:10:56.590 --> 00:11:00.040
They were quite the
offbeat group, they were.

00:11:01.050 --> 00:11:02.100
Let's Find Power Spots!!
Special!

00:11:02.100 --> 00:11:05.500
This shrine is quite famous
for being a power spot

00:11:05.500 --> 00:11:07.420
and is quite popular right now.

00:11:07.880 --> 00:11:12.950
The air in this forest is so clean that
it's hard to believe it's in Tokyo.

00:11:12.950 --> 00:11:15.120
Why not visit?
Power spot, huh?

00:11:16.000 --> 00:11:16.500
Don Power Spot
Conspiracy Case
Countermeasures
Headquarters

00:11:16.500 --> 00:11:20.360
Meeting Room

00:11:21.390 --> 00:11:26.350
I wonder if those without spiritual
senses can enjoy power spots?

00:11:26.350 --> 00:11:28.660
Everyone is seeking healing.

00:11:29.350 --> 00:11:30.770
If they want to feel some healing,

00:11:31.320 --> 00:11:33.020
they just have to step on a minion.

00:11:33.020 --> 00:11:35.630
I'm sure a queen wouldn't
understand this at all.

00:11:35.630 --> 00:11:40.270
Baaaa...

00:11:40.270 --> 00:11:41.520
Shut the hell up.
Baaaa...

00:11:41.520 --> 00:11:43.450
I'll break off your horns
and make Lorenzo eat them.

00:11:43.450 --> 00:11:45.510
Did that really warrant
that kind of response?!

00:11:46.070 --> 00:11:48.290
I am sending you two my power, I am!

00:11:48.290 --> 00:11:49.770
Baaaa...

00:11:50.050 --> 00:11:51.380
Do you feel anything?

00:11:51.650 --> 00:11:52.700
Not really.

00:11:55.160 --> 00:11:57.250
I feel it. I feel it! I feel it!

00:11:57.250 --> 00:11:59.530
I definitely feel it!

00:11:59.530 --> 00:12:03.320
This is Don power...

00:12:03.320 --> 00:12:05.870
O...ver...flow...ing!

00:12:05.870 --> 00:12:09.330
Rumble Rumble Rumble

00:12:09.520 --> 00:12:11.040
Boooom

00:12:11.520 --> 00:12:12.240
Shut the hell up.

00:12:12.240 --> 00:12:13.170
It doesn't hurt!
Shut the hell up.

00:12:13.170 --> 00:12:15.160
It doesn't hurt because of Don power!

00:12:15.160 --> 00:12:15.440
You bag!

00:12:15.440 --> 00:12:15.940
Did you really not feel
anything, Gabriella?
You bag!

00:12:15.940 --> 00:12:16.000
Baaaaa

00:12:16.000 --> 00:12:18.180
Did you really not feel
anything, Gabriella?

00:12:18.180 --> 00:12:18.710
Not at all.

00:12:19.190 --> 00:12:21.740
It could be a compatibility problem.

00:12:21.740 --> 00:12:23.200
You see, the Don and I

00:12:23.200 --> 00:12:25.930
are destined for each other,
according to compatibility readings.

00:12:25.930 --> 00:12:27.760
I have no idea what
you're talking about.

00:12:28.420 --> 00:12:32.450
Well then, I will try to relay the
Don power to you, Gabriella.

00:12:32.450 --> 00:12:33.190
What?

00:12:33.460 --> 00:12:35.230
Baaa
Baaaa...

00:12:35.230 --> 00:12:35.500
Loreeee...

00:12:35.500 --> 00:12:37.150
Loreeee
Loreeee...

00:12:37.710 --> 00:12:39.330
Stop sending me weird energy!

00:12:39.330 --> 00:12:40.570
I don't want any Don power!

00:12:44.630 --> 00:12:45.320
Thud

00:12:45.480 --> 00:12:46.340
Gabriella!

00:12:46.340 --> 00:12:47.620
Our energy was too strong!

00:12:48.190 --> 00:12:49.420
She's not moving...

00:12:50.120 --> 00:12:52.750
Noah! Noah! Call an ambulance!

00:12:53.450 --> 00:12:54.850
Just kidding, you idiots.

00:12:54.850 --> 00:12:56.840
Seriously, you scared me.

00:12:56.840 --> 00:12:58.590
What the hell?!
Looks like you're having fun!

00:12:58.880 --> 00:13:00.300
Oh, you were here, Noah?

00:13:00.690 --> 00:13:02.400
I've been here this whole time.

00:13:02.400 --> 00:13:04.760
Even recluses are alive.

00:13:04.760 --> 00:13:07.910
Tread on a worm and even it will turn.

00:13:07.910 --> 00:13:10.390
There's smoke coming out
of your precious brain.

00:13:10.910 --> 00:13:14.440
Let me refresh!

00:13:14.440 --> 00:13:16.420
This is a time for Don power!

00:13:16.420 --> 00:13:16.500
Baaa
This is a time for Don power!

00:13:16.500 --> 00:13:17.440
Baaa...
Baaa

00:13:17.440 --> 00:13:17.710
Loreeeee...

00:13:17.710 --> 00:13:18.570
Loreeeee...
Baaa...

00:13:18.570 --> 00:13:18.670
Baaa
Loreeeee...

00:13:18.670 --> 00:13:18.770
Brieee
Baaa
Loreeeee...

00:13:18.770 --> 00:13:19.980
Brieeee...
Loreeeee
Baaa
Brieee

00:13:19.980 --> 00:13:22.070
Again, what is that?! No fair!

00:13:22.070 --> 00:13:24.240
I'm the only one who doesn't get it!

00:13:26.700 --> 00:13:28.120
Power spot?

00:13:28.330 --> 00:13:30.770
A place overflowing with spiritual energy.

00:13:30.770 --> 00:13:33.540
Even this hideout is a
power spot for Don power.

00:13:33.540 --> 00:13:36.330
What the heck? You're leaking
that kind of energy, Don?

00:13:36.600 --> 00:13:38.020
Why not charge money for it?

00:13:38.020 --> 00:13:40.000
Power spots are popular, aren't they?

00:13:40.880 --> 00:13:43.750
Good point... Don power...

00:13:44.470 --> 00:13:46.710
It is worth a shot, it is.

00:13:49.420 --> 00:13:51.720
A shrine with a Don power spot?

00:13:51.720 --> 00:13:53.930
What kind of power can that goat have?

00:13:53.930 --> 00:13:54.670
It's a con!

00:13:54.670 --> 00:13:56.230
It's a goat power con!

00:13:56.680 --> 00:13:58.730
I'll go beat down that shrine in no time!

00:13:58.940 --> 00:13:59.660
Let's go!

00:13:59.660 --> 00:14:00.650
Let's go, then....

00:14:00.670 --> 00:14:01.090
Aokigahara Forest

00:14:01.090 --> 00:14:02.590
to Aokigahara Forest.

00:14:02.590 --> 00:14:03.100
Aokigahara Forest

00:14:05.860 --> 00:14:08.780
That's the famous suicide spot
that you can't leave once you enter!

00:14:08.780 --> 00:14:12.100
Why would he build it there?!
That stupid goat!

00:14:12.100 --> 00:14:14.870
Well, he may be a goat,
but he's not stupid.

00:14:15.680 --> 00:14:19.020
They put a shrine altar in front
of a cave within the forest,

00:14:19.750 --> 00:14:23.310
and nearby, they took advantage of
one of Mt. Fuji's underground streams

00:14:23.310 --> 00:14:24.880
and made a spring water pond.

00:14:25.380 --> 00:14:28.040
Then they dropped stones
in there and called them

00:14:28.040 --> 00:14:29.720
"stones of guidance,"
and left them in there.

00:14:30.100 --> 00:14:31.410
Stones of guidance?

00:14:31.410 --> 00:14:31.860
128 yen (2 bags 5 kg)
Gravel
Stones of guidance?

00:14:31.860 --> 00:14:34.640
Just plain ol' gravel that you
can find at a hardware store.
Gravel
128 yen (2 bags 5 kg)

00:14:35.080 --> 00:14:37.490
Those stones are said to lead
the living out of the forest

00:14:37.490 --> 00:14:40.120
and the dead to heaven.

00:14:40.820 --> 00:14:43.350
A lot of curious people
have visited the forest,

00:14:43.350 --> 00:14:44.860
and there's been a huge
increase in missing persons.

00:14:45.140 --> 00:14:47.580
If the rescued person happens
to have the stone in their hand,

00:14:47.580 --> 00:14:49.520
the belief in it becomes stronger,

00:14:49.520 --> 00:14:51.320
and even more people go there
to get their own stone.

00:14:51.680 --> 00:14:52.140
Doesn't sound like the goat
will get much out of this.

00:14:52.140 --> 00:14:54.010
Harassment?
Doesn't sound like the goat
will get much out of this.

00:14:54.010 --> 00:14:54.310
Doesn't sound like the goat
will get much out of this.

00:14:54.310 --> 00:14:57.730
Well, you see, they put
the water from the pond

00:14:57.730 --> 00:14:59.500
and stones of guidance on
an internet auction.

00:14:59.930 --> 00:15:01.060
As you said, that place
is associated with death.

00:15:01.060 --> 00:15:02.950
Your life is a very special gift
given to you by your parents.
Please think about your family
one more time.

00:15:02.950 --> 00:15:03.880
As you said, that place
is associated with death.

00:15:03.880 --> 00:15:05.970
Somehow, that seems to have a weird appeal

00:15:05.970 --> 00:15:08.010
and so they are fetching quite a price.

00:15:08.010 --> 00:15:10.880
That's just the goat
ripping people off online.

00:15:10.880 --> 00:15:12.560
There's no point in going to the forest.

00:15:12.560 --> 00:15:13.800
Not true.

00:15:14.120 --> 00:15:14.190
Calculated

00:15:14.190 --> 00:15:16.940
They calculatingly even
placed an offertory box,

00:15:16.940 --> 00:15:18.270
so we'll use that to our advantage.

00:15:18.630 --> 00:15:20.980
We'll spread a rumor online
that we were so grateful

00:15:20.980 --> 00:15:23.230
that we got out alive that we
donated a large sum of money.

00:15:23.600 --> 00:15:27.050
Knowing Valentino,
he'll immediately come to retrieve it.

00:15:27.570 --> 00:15:29.270
And we'll ambush him in the cave.

00:15:31.560 --> 00:15:32.540
Oh. Good luck, then.

00:15:32.540 --> 00:15:33.240
Come with me.

00:15:33.880 --> 00:15:36.200
Your homing instinct is rather strong.

00:15:36.200 --> 00:15:37.860
Even I have my doubts going in there.

00:15:38.360 --> 00:15:42.210
I would feel much more confident
if you were there with me, Hiroshi.

00:15:47.890 --> 00:15:50.940
You guys are just hopeless.

00:15:51.790 --> 00:15:53.480
Getting scared over some forest.

00:15:55.030 --> 00:15:57.740
Is everyone okay? No one left behind?

00:15:57.740 --> 00:15:59.760
Don't stray too far from me,
'cause you need me!

00:15:59.760 --> 00:16:00.620
Okay.

00:16:00.620 --> 00:16:03.980
Oh, that's right. Don't forget the markings.

00:16:04.560 --> 00:16:06.520
All right! Let's keep going!

00:16:07.070 --> 00:16:08.580
He's pumped up.

00:16:08.580 --> 00:16:10.910
He's just happy that
you're relying on him.

00:16:11.660 --> 00:16:13.240
I always rely on him...

00:16:13.260 --> 00:16:13.690
Goat Shrine

00:16:13.690 --> 00:16:16.100
We found it! The Goat Shrine!
Goat Shrine

00:16:16.100 --> 00:16:17.400
We found it! The Goat Shrine!

00:16:19.070 --> 00:16:20.290
We're here.

00:16:20.290 --> 00:16:21.280
Stones of Guidance

00:16:21.280 --> 00:16:23.250
Oh, this must be it.

00:16:24.450 --> 00:16:27.260
It's just pretty rocks in
pretty water, but there's

00:16:27.260 --> 00:16:28.710
something fascinating about it.

00:16:29.120 --> 00:16:30.910
It really would have a
healing effect if we didn't

00:16:30.910 --> 00:16:32.260
know it was the goat's doing.

00:16:32.260 --> 00:16:34.740
The goat's existence
is totally in the way.

00:16:34.740 --> 00:16:37.830
All that's left is to wait
until Valentino comes.

00:16:37.830 --> 00:16:38.720
A stakeout, huh?

00:16:39.300 --> 00:16:40.560
It's almost like camping.

00:16:45.610 --> 00:16:46.500
Goat!

00:16:46.500 --> 00:16:47.820
Impossible! It's too early!

00:16:48.210 --> 00:16:51.810
Inspector Ogino, you are an
excellent officer, you are.

00:16:51.810 --> 00:16:54.740
But I am better at evil schemes, I am.

00:16:54.860 --> 00:16:57.070
Knowing you, I thought
you would come here

00:16:57.070 --> 00:17:01.570
if we spread rumors
about the forest, I did.

00:17:03.410 --> 00:17:04.200
Here.

00:17:04.200 --> 00:17:05.830
You know what this is, you do.

00:17:06.790 --> 00:17:08.330
The ropes we left as markers!

00:17:10.940 --> 00:17:12.130
Indeed, they are.

00:17:12.130 --> 00:17:15.130
We were following you
the whole time, we were.

00:17:15.380 --> 00:17:18.400
You are as good as dead if you
lose your markers in this forest.

00:17:18.400 --> 00:17:22.350
Get lost together in this endless
forest for eternity and die, you will!

00:17:22.830 --> 00:17:23.730
Wait!

00:17:28.740 --> 00:17:29.820
Damn it.

00:17:35.220 --> 00:17:35.900
Huh?

00:17:36.330 --> 00:17:38.110
You will die, you will!

00:17:42.520 --> 00:17:43.200
Huh?

00:17:43.450 --> 00:17:45.290
You will die, you will!

00:17:50.130 --> 00:17:52.250
We don't know the way out, either.

00:17:52.250 --> 00:17:54.630
Idiots! Idiots! Goat! Goat! Lorenbag!

00:17:57.450 --> 00:18:00.090
Well, now that we've caught
the idiot, the goat, and the bag...

00:18:00.090 --> 00:18:01.140
You have one extra there...

00:18:01.530 --> 00:18:04.140
All that's left is to get back
using my homing instincts.

00:18:04.450 --> 00:18:07.330
What is wrong with you?
Did you not bring a compass?

00:18:07.330 --> 00:18:09.040
Can't say I feel safe
with just the wolf...

00:18:09.040 --> 00:18:10.230
You're ones to talk!

00:18:10.420 --> 00:18:14.700
But, Don, I've heard that there's a
strong magnetic field within the forest

00:18:14.700 --> 00:18:17.320
so compasses won't point
in the right direction.

00:18:17.320 --> 00:18:18.210
He's right.

00:18:18.210 --> 00:18:18.610
Yuuta-kun, you've got two
<i>konpaku</i> up there...

00:18:18.610 --> 00:18:19.780
Konpaku

00:18:19.780 --> 00:18:21.300
And the wrong kind of <i>compass</i>!

00:18:21.300 --> 00:18:23.620
The forest is a very scary place!

00:18:23.620 --> 00:18:23.700
Konpaku

00:18:23.700 --> 00:18:25.750
It will not actually mess up
your compass. Sorry...
Forest                           Trivia
True

00:18:28.930 --> 00:18:30.170
Wolf,

00:18:30.460 --> 00:18:32.090
we will rely on you, we will.

00:18:32.720 --> 00:18:33.930
Make sure you lead us well!

00:18:33.930 --> 00:18:36.090
Shut up! I'm going to
leave you behind, Goat.

00:18:37.390 --> 00:18:38.550
<i>Damn it, everything looks the same.</i>

00:18:38.550 --> 00:18:39.930
Are we there yet?

00:18:39.930 --> 00:18:40.130
it's like we're walking in
the same place over and over.

00:18:40.130 --> 00:18:40.920
Are we there yet? Are we there yet?

00:18:40.920 --> 00:18:42.020
<i>it's like we're walking in
the same place over and over.</i>

00:18:42.020 --> 00:18:43.660
And the goat won't shut up.

00:18:43.660 --> 00:18:44.620
Are we there yet?

00:18:44.620 --> 00:18:45.220
Ogi.

00:18:46.010 --> 00:18:47.880
Are we there yet?
I wonder if this is the right way.

00:18:47.880 --> 00:18:48.580
Are we really going
to be able to get out?

00:18:48.580 --> 00:18:49.980
Are we there yet?
Are we really going
to be able to get out?

00:18:50.870 --> 00:18:51.980
Are we there yet?

00:18:51.980 --> 00:18:53.070
Don't worry.

00:18:53.070 --> 00:18:53.210
Believe in yourself.
Help is on the way, too.

00:18:53.210 --> 00:18:54.360
Are we there yet?
Believe in yourself.
Help is on the way, too.

00:18:54.360 --> 00:18:54.900
Believe in yourself.
Help is on the way, too.

00:18:55.190 --> 00:18:57.610
There's no way help would
come to a place like this.

00:18:57.760 --> 00:19:01.210
If you let us free,
I will use Don power for us, I will.

00:19:01.210 --> 00:19:03.290
Don power makes everyone happy!

00:19:03.290 --> 00:19:03.980
Shut up!

00:19:03.980 --> 00:19:05.080
What is Don power?

00:19:06.310 --> 00:19:09.530
Hey, let's try putting Don power
into this stone of guidance.

00:19:09.530 --> 00:19:09.640
Sorry, Inaba-san, you were that worried?

00:19:09.640 --> 00:19:10.730
Gasp

00:19:10.730 --> 00:19:12.130
Sorry, Inaba-san, you were that worried?

00:19:12.580 --> 00:19:14.240
That was a huge responsibility.

00:19:14.240 --> 00:19:15.610
I'd cry if it were me.

00:19:15.610 --> 00:19:16.830
Is that okay, Ogi?

00:19:16.830 --> 00:19:19.640
I have a feeling this stone
will give me confidence.

00:19:19.640 --> 00:19:21.640
If it makes you feel better...

00:19:22.960 --> 00:19:24.380
All right, do your thing.

00:19:24.380 --> 00:19:25.890
Leave it to me, you will.

00:19:30.260 --> 00:19:31.310
Baaaa!

00:19:31.310 --> 00:19:32.670
Loreee!
Baaaa!

00:19:32.670 --> 00:19:34.040
Why are you doing it, too?!

00:19:34.040 --> 00:19:37.420
Guide us! Guide us
out of the forest!

00:19:38.040 --> 00:19:41.030
Guide us, you will!

00:19:46.760 --> 00:19:48.830
Something actually came out!

00:19:48.830 --> 00:19:51.330
Goat power is scary!

00:19:51.330 --> 00:19:53.000
It's Don power, it is!

00:19:53.000 --> 00:19:54.200
What did you summon?!

00:19:54.200 --> 00:19:55.980
I have no idea!

00:19:57.040 --> 00:19:58.710
Oh, it's just you, old man.

00:19:59.050 --> 00:20:00.920
Wolf...

00:20:01.350 --> 00:20:02.850
What are you doing, old man?

00:20:02.850 --> 00:20:04.690
Inaba-san! The goat! Bubbles!

00:20:04.690 --> 00:20:05.100
Don!
Inaba-san! The goat! Bubbles!

00:20:05.100 --> 00:20:05.890
Don!

00:20:06.410 --> 00:20:07.570
What did you come here for?

00:20:07.570 --> 00:20:09.510
Wh-What is that wolf?

00:20:09.510 --> 00:20:10.550
Do you know it?

00:20:10.550 --> 00:20:11.230
Soumei!

00:20:13.380 --> 00:20:15.100
It's a bit troublesome...

00:20:15.590 --> 00:20:18.900
When you call the wolf "Soumei"
in front of the mafia.

00:20:19.150 --> 00:20:20.820
Quite the act, wasn't it?

00:20:20.820 --> 00:20:22.530
Why are you here, Soumei?

00:20:22.910 --> 00:20:25.020
You know, this bag is in the way...

00:20:25.020 --> 00:20:26.120
Hey!

00:20:26.120 --> 00:20:28.070
You can't show it at time like this,
when nothing is going on!

00:20:28.070 --> 00:20:28.960
What are you thinking?!

00:20:28.960 --> 00:20:30.360
They'll think it's the last episode!

00:20:30.360 --> 00:20:31.840
Don't you have any tact?!

00:20:31.840 --> 00:20:32.520
At your age—

00:20:32.520 --> 00:20:33.950
Shut up!

00:20:33.950 --> 00:20:36.130
I can't walk with this thing on my head!

00:20:36.130 --> 00:20:36.680
I saw it...

00:20:36.680 --> 00:20:37.630
Just a little....

00:20:38.190 --> 00:20:38.940
Jeez.

00:20:39.720 --> 00:20:42.090
You should pick a better area to play.

00:20:42.540 --> 00:20:43.900
We're not playing!

00:20:43.900 --> 00:20:45.860
Why did you come save us?

00:20:45.860 --> 00:20:48.260
I thought I was helping the mafia...

00:20:48.490 --> 00:20:51.180
If you think I saved you,
then you owe me a favor.

00:20:51.970 --> 00:20:53.370
There we go.

00:20:53.370 --> 00:20:54.690
Hey, it's the street.

00:20:55.820 --> 00:20:58.030
All right, you won't cry
if you don't have the

00:20:58.030 --> 00:20:59.150
stone of guidance anymore, will you?

00:21:01.130 --> 00:21:03.070
Hold up, you geezer!

00:21:05.810 --> 00:21:08.090
Don... Don Valentino...

00:21:08.090 --> 00:21:10.870
I heart you, Don Valentino!

00:21:11.180 --> 00:21:12.370
What the hell are you dreaming?

00:21:14.590 --> 00:21:15.560
This is...

00:21:16.080 --> 00:21:18.050
What was I doing, Yataro-dono?

00:21:18.050 --> 00:21:19.630
The Don is on my lap!

00:21:19.630 --> 00:21:21.040
Oh, no! Please don't break!

00:21:21.040 --> 00:21:22.480
Oh delicate plate on my lap,

00:21:22.480 --> 00:21:23.030
It won't break...

00:21:23.030 --> 00:21:26.360
please do not break!

00:21:26.360 --> 00:21:29.810
Yataro-dono, how was I able
to get out of the forest?

00:21:29.810 --> 00:21:31.070
And why is the Don on my lap?!
Who knows?

00:21:31.070 --> 00:21:31.780
When I came to pick you guys up,
you were already on the street.

00:21:31.780 --> 00:21:35.020
Why on my lap?! Why is he on my lap?!

00:21:38.630 --> 00:21:40.610
Stone of Guidance
(Don power included)

00:21:40.860 --> 00:21:43.070
Why, Don?!

00:21:43.070 --> 00:21:43.330
Shake Shake Shake

00:21:43.330 --> 00:21:45.050
Don power is real!

00:21:45.050 --> 00:21:46.850
It guided me!

00:21:46.850 --> 00:21:48.410
Don power has been sealed, it has.

00:21:48.410 --> 00:21:50.860
Get rid of all of the stones
of guidance, we will.

00:21:50.860 --> 00:21:52.260
It makes the wolf come out, it does!

00:21:52.260 --> 00:21:54.010
So, I'm the one who fixed
everything in the end?
Loreee!

00:21:54.010 --> 00:21:56.080
Loreee!

00:23:27.170 --> 00:23:28.950
Whaddya mean?

00:23:28.950 --> 00:23:31.810
You told me you'd let me borrow the
Inaba Blu-ray once it came out!

00:23:32.300 --> 00:23:34.740
Hey, old man, hand it over.

00:23:35.080 --> 00:23:36.520
Have you two forgotten?

00:23:37.000 --> 00:23:38.790
It hasn't been released yet.
